        "notes": "[Bango!](item_b48a6731-fae8-4732-aae0-ceffbf324235) is always the first power pick to get for any primary fire build. The burn effect adds extra damage to your direct hits and can help delete people faster.\n\n [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) is to give a little more survivability and I personally think it's better than  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) just because 25 armor doesn't do much on its own. First Aid Kit at least makes you start regenerating health passively faster than normal.",
