        "notes": "Usually I hold off on going full into firing speed until Round 3 where you get the  [Frags For Days](item_bc48152f-c523-4dc7-afe0-1c016906bc8a) power. \n\nThis is what I usually do this round:\n- Buy  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) to ramp up damage. I almost always buy this first\n- Buy  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) mostly for the firing speed bonus. The movement speed is just a nice extra bonus\n\nAlternatively, you can go for more ammo and get  [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) which gives you 6 grenades and 5% faster firing speed. The faster firing speed doesn't do much but is more noticeable if you keep  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \n\n [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) you can keep if you have spare cash",
