        "notes": "[Frags For Days](item_bc48152f-c523-4dc7-afe0-1c016906bc8a) comes into play and now we focus on getting attack speed up to spam a lot of grenades\n\nSell:\n-  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) We don't need this on a round this late\n-  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) You can buy this back if you end up having leftover money\n\nBuy:\n-  [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) Gives you 7 grenades and increases your attack speed by 10% too. On top of that, using trap or mine gives you some ammo back\n\nOPTIONAL/SITUATIONAL ITEMS:\nIf Rein, Sigma, or Zarya is giving some trouble, consider getting  [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) or a cheaper option  [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66). If you go for either one of these, i'd get  [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) or  [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) to keep you spamming.\n\nNOTE: The [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) attack speed bonus doesn't apply to hitting barriers, but shield HP and armor hp.",
