        "notes": "[Soot Shaker](item_365d55fe-06c9-4600-8369-5f00bd0c5b19) is a great choice here for just using your concussive mine to get insanely faster firing speed right after. You can go for  [Big Bang](item_46b65acb-66a2-43a6-bffb-7b0614b0dcfb) for better random spam kills if you want.\n\nBuy: \n-  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) The bonus against armor doesn't do jack all for Junkrat, but we're getting this for the extra damage for a cheaper price.\n-  [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) would be really great if you have enough money to do it. Otherwise, keep  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) or trade  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) out for  [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34)",
